The datasets used in this study are publicly available. The Gas Sensor Array Drift Dataset is available from the UCI Machine Learning Repository at DOI: 10.24432/C5RP6W.
The Paderborn University Bearing Dataset is publicly available through the Bearing DataCenter of Paderborn University; the associated benchmark publication is available at DOI: 10.36001/phme.2016.v3i1.1577.
